      </b><br>



      <b><font color="#0066FF">Ans:</font></b> To serialize an object into a stream perform the following 



      actions:<br>



      1. Open one of the output streams, for example <b>FileOutputStream.</b><br>



      2. Chain it with the <b>ObjectOutputStream</b> - Call the method <b>



      writeObject()</b> providing the instance of a Serializable object as an 



      argument. <br>



      3.Close the streams <br>



